# RT-HWGI-NIGHT (design F:/aftmp/DESIGN-RT-HWGI-NIGHT.md, Приёмка): the Bistro night under hardware-traced GI, opened right
# after the day street. The GI histories are keyed by the sky they were lit with (GlobalIllumination::LightingHistoryKey:
# sun, moon, sky cube identity, sky gain and yaw), and the sky light is the world's (SceneRenderState::Clear remakes it).
# Numbers, 8-bit frame mean over the whole frame unless stated, same camera and EV100 in every frame:
# C1 hwgi_night_no_blue mean within +-10 % of ss_night and of S_pt (before: S_hw 225 vs S_pt 134).
# C2 hwgi_open_30 <= hwgi_night_no_blue x 1.10; editor.log after the open has NO "deg from the captured one" line, and
#    its first "Sky light recapture begins" is the whole capture, not the 54-slice one.
# C3 day_B16 mean |d| <= 1/255 against the pre-change build.
# C4 profile-dump after the TimeOfDay 22 recapture: RadianceCache + SurfaceCache GPU <= a sun-step frame of the
#    pre-change build; the steady-state GPU frame (after hwgi_night_no_blue) +-0.1 ms of before; [Memory] census +-1 MB
#    once the parked sky light retired.
# C5 (D4, reported, not pass/fail): gi_shield, the GI view of the shield, B/G against S_pt's indirect, same albedo.
# scrub_night: mean = hwgi_night_no_blue +-5 %, taken >= 120 frames after the log's "sky bake 0x... -> 0x..." line for
# the night cube. gain_night: mean |d| per channel <= 3 % of hwgi_night_no_blue.
# ss_night is taken in the same world after the HW frames (not by a second day->night open): the night scene carries
# the exposure edits, and reopening it would stop at the unsaved-scene question. Screen-space GI keeps no world
# history, so the method switch gives the same reference as the open.
# The Bistro night sky is the atmosphere (no SkyboxComponent): its gain step is SkyAtmosphereData.SkyBrightness, a
# recapture (a new cube identity); the SkyLook gain/yaw half of the key is reached only by a panorama sky.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/B16_Bistro_Street.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Anti-Aliasing "Anti-Aliasing: TAA"
Дано run Quality "Quality: Resolution.Percent 100"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Когда frames 240
Тогда-вид day_B16 [day_B16] the B16 day street at the level's methods: mean |d| <= 1/255 against the same frame of the pre-change build (C3)
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 30
Когда run Scene "Open Scene GI_Bistro_Night.desce"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Когда set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.AutoExposure false
Когда set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ManualExposureEV100 0.5260688
Когда set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.EnableBloom false
Когда set 7130000000000010000 ExponentialHeightFogData.Enabled false
Когда frames 30
Тогда-вид hwgi_open_30 [hwgi_open_30] 30 frames after the open the street is already night: mean <= hwgi_night_no_blue x 1.10; лог: after the open no "deg from the captured one", the first "Sky light recapture begins" is the whole capture (C2)
Когда frames 180
Тогда-вид hwgi_night_no_blue [hwgi_night_no_blue] HW GI right after the day street: no white-blue sheet, the shield no brighter than in ss_night; mean within +-10 % of ss_night and of S_pt (C1)
Когда profile-dump
Когда run View "View mode: Indirect Lighting (GI)"
Когда frames 30
Тогда-вид gi_shield [gi_shield] the GI term of the shield under HW GI: its B/G against S_pt's indirect, same albedo (C5, reported for D4)
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method ScreenSpace"
Когда frames 210
Тогда-вид ss_night [ss_night] the reference: screen-space GI, no world history; its mean is the C1/C2 reference
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Off"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 64"
Когда frames 200
Тогда-вид S_pt [S_pt] the path tracer of this build: the C1 reference (134 in scn-1126-123325)
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 180
# D3: day -> night inside one world, no reload: the new night cube is a new identity, so both histories reset when it lands.
Когда set 4576059197435775655 TimeOfDayData.TimeOfDay 12
Когда frames 300
Тогда-вид scrub_noon [scrub_noon] noon in the night world: the day street lit, no night residue (context for scrub_night)
Когда set 4576059197435775655 TimeOfDayData.TimeOfDay 22
Когда frames 300
Тогда-вид scrub_night [scrub_night] back to 22:00 inside one world: no blue sheet; mean = hwgi_night_no_blue +-5 %; лог: the frame is >= 120 frames after "sky bake 0x... -> 0x..." for the night cube
Когда profile-dump
# D5: a sky gain step and back: the histories reset on the way up and on the way down.
Когда set 4576059197435775655 SkyAtmosphereData.SkyBrightness 4
Когда frames 120
Когда set 4576059197435775655 SkyAtmosphereData.SkyBrightness 1
Когда frames 180
Тогда-вид gain_night [gain_night] after the sky gain x4 and back: equals hwgi_night_no_blue, mean |d| per channel <= 3 %
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Resolution.Percent Level"
